r><classification-ecla status="new"><classification-symbol scheme="EC">F15B  13/02D</classification-symbol></classification-ecla><invention-title load-source="docdb" status="new" lang="EN">FLOW DIVIDING VALVE</invention-title><invention-title load-source="docdb"  status="new" lang="FR">SOUPAPE REPARTITRICE DE DEBIT</invention-title><citations><patent-citations><patcit ucid="JP-5044704-A" status="new"><document-id status="new" format="epo"><country>JP</country><doc-number>5044704</doc-number><kind>A</kind></document-id><sources><source category="X" name="SEA"  created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit><patcit ucid="JP-54074523-A"  status="new"><document-id status="new"  format="epo"><country>JP</country><doc-number>54074523</doc-number><kind>A</kind> </document-id><sources><source category="A" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit><patcit ucid="JP-63139302-U" status="new"><document-id status="new" format="epo"><country>JP</country><doc-number>63139302</doc-number> <kind>U</kind> </document-id> <sources><source category="A" name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></patcit></patent-citations><non-patent-citations><nplcit status="new"><text>See also references of EP     1035332A1</text><sources><source name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></nplcit></non-patent-citations></citations></technical-data><parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>CATERPILLAR MITSUBISHI LTD</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SHIMADA YOSHIYUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SHIMADA, YOSHIYUKI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SHIN CATERPILLAR MITSUBISHI LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SHIMADA YOSHIYUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SHIMADA, YOSHIYUKI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A flow dividing valve capable of instantaneously and continuously setting a flow rate ratio at which a flow rate at an inlet port is divided to a plurality of outlet ports, comprising a flow rate control spool for diving the flow rate at the inlet port at a specified flow rate ratio and a flow rate ratio setting spool for setting the flow rate ratio so as to control the flow rate control spool, whereby the flow rate ratio setting spool can be controlled by control signals from the outside.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>La présente invention concerne une soupape répartitrice de débit capable, instantanément et en continu, de fixer un rapport de débit . Un débit déterminé au niveau d'un orifice d'entrée est subdivisé entre une pluralité d'orifices de sortie. Cette soupape comprend un tiroir de commande de débit qui subdivise le débit au niveau d'un orifice d'entrée selon un rapport spécifié, et un tiroir de réglage du rapport de débit qui est conçu pour commander le tiroir de commande de débit, et qui est lui-même commandé par des signaux provenant de l'extérieur.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>